Package: mcrelay
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: adduser, init-system-helpers (>= 1.18~), libc6, libcjson1, libsystemd0
Maintainer: Bilin Tsui <bilintsui@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Minecraft reverse proxy server with server address rewrite
 mcrelay is a reverse proxy for Minecraft servers that routes client
 connections to upstream servers based on the server address sent in the
 Minecraft handshake packet. It can rewrite the address/port to disguise a
 connection as one to an official server, and forward the real client address
 and port to the backend using HAProxy's Proxy Protocol.
